@startuml component_diagram

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontSize 13

left to right direction

package "TODO Application" {

    component "Entry Point\n(main)" as Main

    package "CLI Layer" {
        component "Interactive Menu" as IM
        component "Command-line Interface\n(TodoCLI)" as CLI
    }

    package "Service Layer" {
        component "Todo Service" as SVC
        component "Task Manager" as MGR
        component "Comment Manager" as CMT
        component "Project Manager" as PROJ
    }

    package "Domain Model" {
        component "Task Model\n(Task, TaskStatus)" as Model
        component "TaskComment Model" as CMTModel
        component "Project Model" as ProjModel
        component "TaskStatistics Model" as StatsModel
    }

    package "Persistence Layer" {
        component "JSON Storage\n(JsonStorage)" as Storage
    }

    package "Utility Layer" {
        component "Timezone Utils\n(TimezoneUtils)" as TZ
    }
}

database "todo_data.json" as DB
database ".todo_projects.json" as PROJDB

Main --> IM : interactive mode
Main --> CLI : command mode

IM --> SVC
CLI --> SVC

SVC --> MGR
SVC --> CMT
SVC --> PROJ
MGR --> Storage
CMT --> Storage
PROJ --> Storage
MGR --> TZ : uses (for filtering)
MGR ..> Model
CMT ..> CMTModel
PROJ ..> ProjModel
SVC ..> StatsModel : returns (get_statistics)
Storage ..> Model
Storage ..> CMTModel
Storage ..> ProjModel

Storage --> DB : read/write (tasks/comments)
Storage --> PROJDB : read/write (projects)

@enduml